# 20.4 (Baechle): cut groups (every x conjugate to x^k or x^-k for all k coprime to o(x)).
# (b) is a Sylow 3-subgroup of a cut group cut?  (c) soluble cut G: does exp(O_p(G)) divide p for p in {5,7}?
